# Shell scripts and systemd units must keep LF line endings: a CRLF shebang or
# "set -o pipefail\r" makes bash fail on the server. Windows checkouts convert
# text files by default (core.autocrlf=true), which also affected `git archive`.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.timer text eol=lf
*.example text eol=lf
